<title>USA: Ipalco offers to buyback up to 12 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Ipalco offers to buyback up to 12 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ipalco Enterprises Inc said Friday it would offer to buy up to 12 million shares of its common stock at a purchase price not greater than $34 per share and not less than $29 per share.</p>
<p>The company said the offer, the proration period and withdrawal rights expires at midnight EST on March 27.</p>
<p>Ipalco, based in Indianapolis, first announced its plans to self tender the shares in a dutch auction on Feb 25. The company also said at that time it would reduce its quarterly dividend to $0.25 per share from $0.37 per share.</p>
</text>
